SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 UTC+1: Unearthodox Exploration Co-Lab 2027: Edges of
  Possibility
DESCRIPTION:Closes 16 Nov 2026 at 23:59 UTC+1.\n\nOnline incubator from Swi
 ss foundation Unearthodox (formerly the Luc Hoffmann Institute) for innova
 tors with early-stage ideas at the intersection of environmental and socie
 tal challenges\, aimed at work that tackles root causes in the relationshi
 p between people\, society and nature rather than symptoms: climate\, biod
 iversity\, habitat loss\, regeneration and environmental justice among the
 m.\n\nOrganisation: Unearthodox\nLocation: Online\; group sessions designe
 d around time zones UTC-6 to UTC+6. Open worldwide to applicants over 18\;
  applications in English.\nAward: CHF 10\,000 grant per selected initiativ
 e\, plus a 10-month incubation programme with tailored coaching\, expert s
 upport\, peer learning\, systems mapping and futures-thinking support. No 
 application fee.\nDuration: 10 months\, 1 March to 31 December 2027\n\nMor
 e: https://unearthodox.org/2026/09/open-call-edges-of-possibility-explorat
 ion-co-lab-2027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://unearthodox.org/2026/09/open-call-edges-of-possibility-explorat
 ion-co-lab-2027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Online\; group sessions designed around time zones UTC-6 to UTC+6.
  Open worldwide to applicants over 18\; applications in English.
END:VEVENT
